  "description": "Tie an overhand knot as the Howcast clip does (knotlab.demo.demo_steps): lay the standing part and the loop, lay the end over the standing part, the left hand lifts the loop strand while the right hand tucks the end under it, draw the end out over the loop's far side, pull both tails, verify."
